Description: encrypted password manager with a graphical interface
 SecretLin stores logins (site, user name, password) in a local vault
 protected by a master password.
 .
 The vault is encrypted with AES-256-GCM and the key is derived from the
 master password with Argon2id. Any change to the vault file is detected,
 the application locks itself after a short inactivity and the clipboard
 is cleared 20 seconds after a password is copied.
